/data/
# Where a Visual Studio / dotnet run keeps its database, settings and secrets.
/.localdata/
# Belt and braces: a stored secret must never be committable, wherever it ends up.
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
*.pfx
secrets.env
.env
# Local agent/session notes. They accumulate the specifics of one machine -- share paths, host addresses,
# the token a test deployment is running with -- none of which belong in a public repository.
AGENTS.md

