## OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# local preview scratch
.preview/
.claude/
# Belt and braces, as with the secrets above: .claude/ already covers this, but the agent's memory is
# notes about one person working on one machine -- what they have asked for, how they want to be worked
# with -- and it must stay uncommittable even if .claude/ is ever narrowed to share launch.json.
.claude/memory/
/settings.json
*.db-journal
